msgstr "Prijungta paskyra"

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/halloween.tsx:55
msgid "Costumes may be heroic, humorous, or unsettling, allowing people to step briefly into different roles."
msgstr "Kostiumai gali būti herojiški, juokingi ar šiurpūs — leidžiantys trumpam įkūnyti kitas roles."

#: src/features/weather/ui/details/air-quality-detail.tsx:75
msgid "Current AQI"
msgstr "Dabartinis AQI"

#: src/features/settings/ui/sections/weather-settings.tsx:108
msgid "Data & alerts"
msgstr "Duomenys ir įspėjimai"

