msgstr "Dabar jaučiasi"

#: src/features/settings/ui/sections/integrations-settings.tsx:56
msgid "Finance"
msgstr "Finansai"

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/geminids.tsx:84
msgid "Find a wide view of the sky, allow your eyes time to adjust, and settle in — the display often strengthens after midnight."
msgstr "Raskite plačią dangaus panoramą, leiskite akims prisitaikyti ir patogiai įsitaisykite — pasirodymas dažnai sustiprėja po vidurnakčio."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/hanukkah.tsx:71
msgid "Foods fried in oil, including latkes and sufganiyot, reflect the central symbol of the story."
msgstr "Aliejuje kepti patiekalai, įskaitant latkes ir sufganiyot, primena pagrindinį šios istorijos simbolį."

#: src/features/seasonal-events/definitions/diwali.tsx:50
msgid "For many Hindus, the festival marks the return of Rama, Sita, Lakshmana, and Hanuman to Ayodhya after their long exile."
msgstr "Daugeliui hinduistų ši šventė mini Ramos, Sitos, Lakšmanos ir Hanumano sugrįžimą į Ajodhją po ilgos tremties."

#: src/features/dashboard/ui/view-indicator.tsx:32
msgid "forecast"
msgstr "prognozė"

#: src/features/settings/ui/sections/weather-settings.tsx:73
msgid "Forecast"
msgstr "Orų prognozė"

#: src/features/settings/ui/sections/integrations-settings.tsx:57
msgid "Freelance"
msgstr "Laisvai samdomas darbas"

